  "releaseNotes": "### 0.2.263\n            - Updated dependencies to 10.25.x\n            - Added support for Dynamicweb 10.25\n            - Minor bug fixes and performance improvements\n            ### 0.2.262\n            - Treat unavailable or unauthorized private feeds as non-fatal during search and resolution\n            - Log skipped feeds while continuing with remaining NuGet sources\n            - Protect stored feed credentials and migrate legacy credential formats\n            ### 0.2.211\n            - Resolved NotSupportedException\n            ### 0.2.2\n            - Updated dependencies to 10.25.x\n            - Added support for Dynamicweb 10.25\n            - Minor bug fixes and performance improvements\n            ### 0.2.0\n            - Updated dependencies to 10.15.x\n            - Added support for Dynamicweb 10.15\n            - Added support for private feed management in UI\n            - Minor bug fixes and performance improvements\n            ### 0.1.0\n            - Initial release",
